  m_Name: RelativeLetter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BBQKing::BBQKing.Core.MessageData
  title: A letter for you
  body: '[Placeholder: the relative''s name and the final wording are still to be decided.]


    If you are reading this, the house is yours now. I am sorry I let the backyard get away from me. The old grill on the patio still has a few good cookouts left in it, and so do you.


    Start with the patio. Everything else follows.


    With love,

    [Name]'
